2. If drawn on a boundary survey, the date of survey and source of data;
3. Date of sketch plan drawing, and revision dates, if applicable;
4. North arrow and graphic engineering scale;
5. Location (land district, address, and tax map and parcel number) and size of the property in acres (or in square feet if less than an acre);
